  lines:
  - Do you yearn for your past?
  - "<?ShakeCamera><?CamSwitchSpeed=.5><shake a=1>It\u2019s your fault."
  - The joys and sorrows long gone?
  - "<?ShakeCamera><?CamSwitchSpeed=.5><shake a=3>It\u2019s all your fault."
  - Or are you just deceiving yourself?
  - <?ShakeCamera><?CamSwitchSpeed=.5><shake a=5>YOUR FAULT!!!
  - "Keep it up though, it\u2019s entertaining."
